  "description": "Field Trip Waiver records trip destination, transport, activity condition, supervision, guardian choice, and return. Field Trip Waiver evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this field trip waiver risk acknowledgment when staff must document trip destination and transport. Reconcile activity condition, supervision, guardian choice, and return before the field trip waiver handoff. Use the itinerary, transportation plan, disclosed activity conditions, supervision roster, accessible alternative, participant questions, guardian choice, and return headcount. This acknowledgment concerns an excursion with bus or walking travel, off-site terrain, destination activities, chaperone supervision, group movement, and school return. Ask the assigned field trip waiver reviewer to confirm trip destination against the organization's policy.",
